ue\">\n                                    recruiter@outlook.com\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-10 border-t border-[var(--surface)]/25 pt-4 js-mono text-[9px] leading-4 text-[var(--surface)]/55\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-4-2-1-3\" data-name=\"Case metadata\">\n                            Source: pasted text\n                            <br data-kid=\"2-1-2-4-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"Metadata line break\"/>\n                            Received 02 Sep 2026 · 10:42\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-[var(--paper)] p-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"Evidence panel\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Evidence header\">\n                            <div class=\"js-label\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-4-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Evidence label\">\n                                Evidence / extracted text\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"border border-[var(--teal)] px-2 py-1 js-mono text-[9px] uppercase text-[var(--teal)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-4-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"Edit status tag\">\n                                Editable\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-4 flex border-b-2 border-[var(--ink)] js-mono text-[10px] uppercase\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"Evidence tab list\">\n                            <div class=\"border-b-2 border-[var(--copper)] px-3 py-2 font-semibold\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-4-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Evidence text tab\">\n                                Paste text\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[var(--ink)]/45\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-4-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"Evidence image tab\">\n                                Image\n                  