       </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"shrink-0 js-mono text-right text-[10px] uppercase text-[var(--high)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-5-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"Scenario risk tag\">\n                                <span class=\"mb-2 block h-[3px] w-8 bg-[var(--high)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-5-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Risk bar\">\n                                </span>\n                                High risk\n                                <br data-kid=\"2-1-2-5-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"Risk text line break\"/>\n                                pattern\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-[var(--raised)] p-5 text-[var(--surface)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-5-2-3\" data-name=\"Demo scenario 3\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between js-label\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-5-2-3-1\" data-name=\"Scenario header\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"2-1-2-5-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"Scenario label\">\n                                Demo 03 / urgent\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[var(--very-high)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-5-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"Risk range indicator\">\n                                81–100\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-6 flex items-start justify-between gap-4\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-5-2-3-2\" data-name=\"Scenario content\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"2-1-2-5-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"Scenario body\">\n                                <div class=\"text-[16px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-5-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Scenario title\">\n                                    High-income remote offer\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"mt-2 max-w-[250px] text-[12px] leading-5 text-[var(--surface)]/65\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-5-2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"Scenario description\">\n                                    Unusually strong salary promise, payment request, and urgent response language.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"shrink-0 js-mono text-right text-[10px] uppercase text-[var(--very-high)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-5-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"Scenario risk tag\">\n                                <span class=\"mb-2 block h-[3px] w-8 bg-[var(--very-high)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-5-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Risk bar\">\n                                </span>\n                                Very high\n                                <br data-kid=\"2-1-2-5-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"Risk text line break\"/>\n                                indicators\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-4 border-l-2 border-[var(--teal)] pl-3 js-mono text-[10px] leading-4 uppercase text-[var(--ink)]/60\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-5-3\" data-name=\"Demo section disclaimer\">\n                    Demo scenarios are sample postings for interface review. They are not guarantees about any employer or job.\n                </div>\n            </section>\n            <section aria-labelledby=\"report-heading\" class=\"border-b-2 border-[var(--ink)] p-7\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6\" data-name=\"Assessment section\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-end justify-between\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-1\" data-name=\"Assessment header\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-1-1\" data-name=\"Heading container\">\n                        <div class=\"js-label text-[var(--copper)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-1-1-1\" data-name=\"Assessment label\">\n                            03 / Report state\n                        </div>\n                        <h2 class=\"mt-2 text-[32px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-1-1-2\" data-name=\"Assessment heading\" id=\"report-heading\">\n                            AI risk assessment\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"js-mono text-[10px] uppercase text-[var(--ink)]/55\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-1-2\" data-name=\"Assessment case info\">\n                        Selected case / JS-018\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-[34%_66%] border-2 border-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2\" data-name=\"Assessment grid\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-[var(--raised)] p-6 text-[var(--surface)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1\" data-name=\"Source data panel\">\n                        <div class=\"js-label text-[var(--copper)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Source label\">\n                            Source retained\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-8 text-[18px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1-2\" data-name=\"Source title\">\n                            Customer success associate\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-2 js-mono text-[10px] uppercase text-[var(--surface)]/55\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1-3\" data-name=\"Source info\">\n                            Northline Careers · pasted text\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"mt-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--copper)] pl-4 text-[13px] leading-6 text-[var(--surface)]/75\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1-4\" data-name=\"Source snippet\">\n                            “Pay a registration fee before your interview to reserve your place. Earn up to $8,000 monthly with no experience.”\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-8 border-t border-[var(--surface)]/25 pt-4 js-mono text-[10px] text-[var(--surface)]/55\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1-5\" data-name=\"Source processing date\">\n                            Demo Data · report preview\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-8 border-t border-[var(--surface)]/25 pt-4\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1-6\" data-name=\"Input handling section\">\n                            <div class=\"js-mono text-[9px] uppercase text-[var(--surface)]/45\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1-6-1\" data-name=\"Handling label\">\n                                Input handling\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-2 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[var(--surface)]/70\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1-6-2\" data-name=\"Handling explanation\">\n                                Text can be edited before the assessment. Uploaded files are temporary.\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-7 border-t border-[var(--surface)]/25 pt-4\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1-7\" data-name=\"Observed categories section\">\n                            <div class=\"js-mono text-[9px] uppercase text-[var(--surface)]/45\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1-7-1\" data-name=\"Category label\">\n                                Observed categories\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-3 gap-y-3 js-mono text-[9px] uppercase text-[var(--surface)]/70\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1-7-2\" data-name=\"Categories list\">\n                                <div data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1-7-2-1\" data-name=\"Payment category\">\n                                    <span class=\"mr-2 inline-block h-2 w-2 bg-[var(--high)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1-7-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Category marker\">\n                                    </span>\n                                    Payment request\n                                </div>\n                                <div data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1-7-2-2\" data-name=\"Salary category\">\n                                    <span class=\"mr-2 inline-block h-2 w-2 bg-[var(--high)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1-7-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Category marker\">\n                                    </span>\n                                    Salary claim\n                                </div>\n                                <div data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1-7-2-3\" data-name=\"Urgency category\">\n                                    <span class=\"mr-2 inline-block h-2 w-2 bg-[var(--moderate)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1-7-2-3-1\" data-name=\"Category marker\">\n                                    </span>\n                                    Urgency\n                                </div>\n                                <div data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1-7-2-4\" data-name=\"Company category\">\n                                    <span class=\"mr-2 inline-block h-2 w-2 bg-[var(--moderate)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-1-7-2-4-1\" data-name=\"Category marker\">\n                                    </span>\n                                    Company context\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-[var(--paper)] p-6 shadow-[-12px_8px_0_rgba(22,32,31,0.18)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2\" data-name=\"Assessment details panel\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between js-label\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Details header\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Assessment label\">\n                                Assessment\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[var(--very-high)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"Preliminary status\">\n                                Preliminary\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-2\" data-name=\"Risk summary\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-end justify-between js-mono text-[10px] uppercase\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Risk score container\">\n                                <span data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Score label\">\n                                    Risk score / 0–100\n                                </span>\n                                <strong class=\"text-[42px] leading-none text-[var(--very-high)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"Score value\">\n                                    87\n                                    <span class=\"text-[15px] text-[var(--ink)]/45\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"Score maximum\">\n                                        /100\n                                    </span>\n                                </strong>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-4 flex h-3 border-2 border-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"Risk bar container\">\n                                <div class=\"w-[30%] bg-[var(--low)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Bar 1\">\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"w-[30%] bg-[var(--moderate)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"Bar 2\">\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"w-[20%] bg-[var(--high)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"Bar 3\">\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"relative w-[20%] bg-[var(--very-high)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"Bar 4\">\n                                    <span class=\"risk-marker absolute -top-2 left-[30%] h-7 w-1 bg-[var(--ink)]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"Risk marker\" data-reason=\"animation sweep of marker relative to container\">\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-2 flex justify-between js-mono text-[9px] uppercase text-[var(--ink)]/55\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"Risk range labels\">\n                                <span data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"Label 1\">\n                                    0 Lower\n                                </span>\n                                <span data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"Label 2\">\n                                    31 Moderate\n                                </span>\n                                <span data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"Label 3\">\n                                    61 High\n                                </span>\n                                <span data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-2-3-4\" data-name=\"Label 4\">\n                                    81 Very high\n                                </span>\n                                <span data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-2-3-5\" data-name=\"Label 5\">\n                                    100\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-6 border-y-2 border-[var(--ink)] py-4\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-3\" data-name=\"Risk alert area\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"Alert header\">\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-triangle-alert text-[22px] text-[var(--very-high)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"Alert icon\">\n                                </i>\n                                <div data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"Alert text block\">\n                                    <div class=\"text-[20px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"Alert title\">\n                                        Very High risk indicators\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"js-mono text-[10px] uppercase text-[var(--very-high)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-6-2-2-3-1-2-2\" data-name