    </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-6 border-t-2 border-[var(--ink)] pt-4 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[var(--ink)]/70\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-9-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"Help text\">\n                                <span class=\"font-semibold\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-9-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Bold 1\">\n                                    Precision\n                                </span>\n                                asks how often a suspicious prediction is correct.\n                                <span class=\"font-semibold\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-9-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"Bold 2\">\n                                    Recall\n                                </span>\n                                asks how many suspicious patterns the model finds.\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-5 grid grid-cols-3 border-2 border-[var(--ink)] bg-[var(--raised)] text-[var(--surface)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-9-3\" data-name=\"Console details strip\">\n                    <div class=\"border-r border-[var(--surface)]/25 p-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-9-3-1\" data-name=\"Model field\">\n                        <div class=\"js-mono text-[9px] uppercase text-[var(--surface)]/50\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-9-3-1-1\" data-name=\"Label\">\n                            Selected model\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-3 text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-9-3-1-2\" data-name=\"Value\">\n                            Unavailable\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"border-r border-[var(--surface)]/25 p-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-9-3-2\" data-name=\"Confidence field\">\n                        <div class=\"js-mono text-[9px] uppercase text-[var(--surface)]/50\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-9-3-2-1\" data-name=\"Label\">\n                            Model confidence\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-3 text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-9-3-2-2\" data-name=\"Value\">\n                            Unavailable\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"p-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-9-3-3\" data-name=\"State field\">\n                        <div class=\"js-mono text-[9px] uppercase text-[var(--surface)]/50\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-9-3-3-1\" data-name=\"Label\">\n                            Operating state\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-3 text-[16px] text-[var(--copper)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-9-3-3-2\" data-name=\"Value\">\n                            Demo Mode\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-7 border-l-2 border-[var(--teal)] pl-4 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[var(--ink)]/65\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-9-4\" data-name=\"Evaluation note\">\n                    <span class=\"js-mono text-[10px] uppercase text-[var(--teal)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-9-4-1\" data-name=\"Note label\">\n                        Evaluation note\n                    </span>\n                    <br data-kid=\"2-1-2-9-4-2\" data-name=\"Note line break\"/>\n                    Evaluation results are not available. JobShield AI is currently in Demo Mode. No accuracy, precision, recall, or F1 values are shown until they are generated from a validated dataset.\n                </div>\n            </section>\n            <footer class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.5fr_1fr_1fr] gap-0 bg-[var(--raised)] px-7 py-7 text-[var(--surface)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-10\" data-name=\"Footer section\">\n                <div class=\"border-r border-[var(--surface)]/20 pr-8\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-10-1\" data-name=\"Brand block\">\n                    <div class=\"text-[18px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-10-1-1\" data-name=\"Brand name\">\n                        JobShield AI\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 max-w-[350px] text-[12px] leading-5 text-[var(--surface)]/65\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-10-1-2\" data-name=\"Footer description\">\n                        Check Before You Apply. Use a preliminary AI-assisted assessment, then verify the employer independently.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"border-r border-[var(--surface)]/20 px-8\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-10-2\" data-name=\"Privacy block\">\n                    <div class=\"js-label text-[var(--copper)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-10-2-1\" data-name=\"Privacy label\">\n                        Privacy note\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-[11px] leading-5 text-[var(--surface)]/65\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-10-2-2\" data-name=\"Privacy disclaimer\">\n                        Files are temporary and should not include passwords, OTPs, bank credentials, or other sensitive information.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"pl-8\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-10-3\" data-name=\"Input policy block\">\n                    <div class=\"js-label text-[var(--copper)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-10-3-1\" data-name=\"Input policy label\">\n                        Input policy\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-[11px] leading-5 text-[var(--surface)]/65\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-10-3-2\" data-name=\"Input policy text\">\n                        Accepted files: JPG, JPEG, PNG, PDF, TXT. Maximum file size: 10 MB. Demo Data is clearly marked throughout.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </footer>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-09-02T17:26:03.380900+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-09-02T17:26:03.380900+00:00",
      "id": "var_45b39465e69f",
      "viewportScrollY": 0
    },
    "var_a46f94bd9868": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "JobShield AI — Porcelain Inspection Lab",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 3080,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1440,
        "h": 800
      },
      "html": "<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Familjen+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=Recursive:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');\n@import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont/tabler-icons.min.css');\n\n.jobshield-shell { font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif; }\n.jobshield-display { font-family: 'Familjen Grotesk', sans-serif; }\n.jobshield-mono { font-family: 'Recursive', monospace; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.clip-corner { clip-path: polygon(0 0, calc(100% - 13px) 0, 100% 13px, 100% 100%, 0 100%); }\n.clip-corner-small { clip-path: polygon(0 0, calc(100% - 8px) 0, 100% 8px, 100% 100%, 0 100%); }\n.selected-bracket { background: #EEF3F5; }\n.selected-bracket > td:first-child { border-left: 4px solid #183A72; }\n@media (min-width: 768px) {\n  #workflow .mt-16.grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr)); }\n  #workflow .mt-16.grid > article:nth-child(1) { grid-column: span 4 / span 4; }\n  #workflow .mt-16.grid > article:nth-child(2) { grid-column: span 5 / span 5; }\n  #workflow .mt-16.grid > article:nth-child(3) { grid-column: span 3 / span 3; }\n}\n#workflow .mt-16.grid > article:nth-child(3) { border-top-width: 4px; border-top-color: #257A58; background: #F5FAF8; }\n#dashboard .grid.grid-cols-6 { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; padding-left: 6.76%; padding-right: 4.41%; font-size: 11px; }\n#dashboard .grid.grid-cols-6 > span { width: 0; min-width: 0; flex: none; white-space: nowrap; text-align: center; }\n#dashboard .grid.grid-cols-6 > span:first-child { text-align: left; }\n#dashboard .grid.grid-cols-6 > span:last-child { text-align: right; }\n#dashboard .grid.grid-cols-10.gap-2.px-3.text-center { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1rem; }\n#dashboard svg + .grid.grid-cols-6 { display: flex !important; }\n#dashboard svg[viewBox=\"0 0 680 220\"] { height: auto; aspect-ratio: 680 / 220; }\n#dashboard .grid.h-48.grid-cols-10 > div:nth-child(1) > div:nth-child(2) { height: 50% !important; }\n#dashboard .grid.h-48.grid-cols-10 > div:nth-child(2) > div:nth-child(2) { height: 75% !important; }\n#dashboard .grid.h-48.grid-cols-10 > div:nth-child(3) > div:nth-child(2) { height: 25% !important; }\n#dashboard .grid.h-48.grid-cols-10 > div:nth-child(4) > div:nth-child(2) { height: 50% !important; }\n#dashboard .grid.h-48.grid-cols-10 > div:nth-child(5) > div:nth-child(2) { height: 75% !important; }\n#dashboard .grid.h-48.grid-cols-10 > div:nth-child(6) > div:nth-child(2) { height: 100% !important; }\n#dashboard .grid.h-48.grid-cols-10 > div:nth-child(7) > div:nth-child(2) { height: 50% !important; }\n#dashboard .grid.h-48.grid-cols-10 > div:nth-child(8) > div:nth-child(2) { height: 75% !important; }\n#dashboard .grid.h-48.grid-cols-10 > div:nth-child(9) > div:nth-child(2) { height: 50% !important; }\n#dashboard .grid.h-48.grid-cols-10 > div:nth-child(10) > div:nth-child(2) { height: 50% !important; }\n#model-performance [class~=\"grid-cols-[62px_1fr_1fr]\"] { grid-template-columns: 82px minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); font-size: 11px; }\n#model-performance [class~=\"grid-cols-[62px_1fr_1fr]\"] > div:nth-child(4) { padding: 1.5rem 1rem; }\n#model-performance [class~=\"grid-cols-[62px_1fr_1fr]\"] > div:nth-child(n+5) { min-height: 76px; padding: 0.75rem; }\nspan[class*=\"border-[#A66A00]\"], span[class*=\"border-[#257A58]\"], span[class*=\"border-[#C55216]\"], span[class*=\"border-[#B52A32]\"], #workspace div[class*=\"inline-block\"][class*=\"border-[#A66A00]\"] { font-size: 11px; }\n.risk-fill { transform-origin: left center; animation: riskFill 450ms ease-out both; }\n@keyframes riskFill { from { transform: scaleX(0); } to { transform: scaleX(1); } }\n</style>\n<main class=\"jobshield-shell overflow-x-clip bg-[#EEF3F5] text-[#17242B]\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"main page layout container\">\n    <header class=\"border-b-[1.5px] border-[#AFC2CA] bg-[#EEF3F5]\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"header section\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto flex h-14 max-w-[1320px] items-center justify-between px-6 sm:px-10 xl:px-0\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"header layout container\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"logo and brand description container\">\n                <div class=\"jobshield-display text-[18px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand name\">\n                    JobShield AI\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"hidden border-l border-[#AFC2CA] pl-4 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#52656E] sm:inline\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"brand tag line\">\n                    AI-assisted risk assessment\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-5 sm:gap-8\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"navigation and menu container\">\n                <nav aria-label=\"Product sections\" class=\"hidden items-center gap-7 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#183A72] md:flex\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"main navigation links container\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"navigation link 1\">\n                        How it works\n                    </span>\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"navigation link 2\">\n                        Model performance\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"border-b border-[#183A72] pb-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"navigation link 3\">\n                        Analyze a job\n                    </span>\n                </nav>\n                <button aria-label=\"Open menu\" class=\"border border-[#183A72] px-2 py-1 text-[18px] text-[#183A72] md:hidden\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"mobile menu button\" type=\"button\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-menu-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"menu hamburger icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <section class=\"border-b-[1.5px] border-[#AFC2CA]\" data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"hero section\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1320px] px-6 py-12 sm:px-10 sm:py-16 xl:px-0 xl:py-20\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"hero content container\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"hero grid layout\">\n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-5 lg:pt-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"hero text content container\">\n                    <div class=\"jobshield-mono mb-6 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"hero pre-headline label\">\n                        Check Before You Apply.\n                    </div>\n                    <h1 class=\"jobshield-display max-w-[510px] text-[clamp(3.5rem,6vw,5.35rem)] font-semibold leading-[0.93] tracking-[-0.06em] text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"hero main headline\">\n                        Is This Job Really Safe?\n                    </h1>\n                    <p class=\"mt-7 max-w-[500px] text-[19px] leading-[1.38] text-[#17242B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"hero description text\">\n                        Use AI to analyze suspicious job postings and understand potential risk indicators before you apply.\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-7 max-w-[465px] border-l-2 border-[#183A72] pl-4 text-[15px] leading-6 text-[#3D515A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-4\" data-name=\"hero warning disclaimer\">\n                        JobShield AI highlights patterns worth checking; it does not determine whether an employer is fraudulent.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-7 gap-y-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-5\" data-name=\"hero action buttons container\">\n                        <button class=\"clip-corner bg-[#183A72] px-6 py-3 text-[15px] font-semibold text-white hover:bg-[#102E5C] focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-[#D9A441] focus-visible:outline-offset-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-5-1\" data-name=\"primary call-to-action button\" type=\"button\">\n                            Analyze a job\n                        </button>\n                        <span class=\"border-b border-[#183A72] pb-1 text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-5-2\" data-name=\"secondary link label\">\n                            How it works\n                            <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ml-2 text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-5-2-1\" data-name=\"up-right arrow icon\">\n                                ↗\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mt-12 flex max-w-[480px] items-center gap-3 border-t border-[#AFC2CA] pt-4 text-[12px] text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-6\" data-name=\"input readiness status container\">\n                        <span class=\"jobshield-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-6-1\" data-name=\"input status label\">\n                            Input ready\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"h-1 w-1 bg-[#257A58]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-6-2\" data-name=\"status indicator dot\">\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-6-3\" data-name=\"input description text\">\n                            Paste, upload an image, or add a PDF / TXT file\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-7\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"hero demo interface container\">\n                    <div class=\"clip-corner border-[1.5px] border-[#183A72] bg-[#F9FCFD]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"demo interface box\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 border-b border-[#AFC2CA] px-5 py-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between sm:px-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"demo header container\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"demo header text\">\n                                <div class=\"jobshield-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"demo sub-headline\">\n                                    Quick check / demo input\n                                </div>\n                                <h2 class=\"jobshield-display mt-1 text-[25px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#17242B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"demo title\">\n                                    Review a posting before you apply\n                                </h2>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"jobshield-mono w-fit border border-[#A66A00] px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#A66A00]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"demo mode badge\">\n                                Demo Mode\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div aria-label=\"Job posting source\" class=\"flex border-b border-[#AFC2CA] text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"input source selection tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n                            <button aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-b-2 border-[#183A72] px-5 py-4 sm:px-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"tab button 1\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\">\n                                <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"file search icon\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-file-search\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"file search icon inner\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </span>\n                                Paste text\n                            </button>\n                            <button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-4 text-[#61727A] sm:px-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"tab button 2\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\">\n                                <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"scan text icon\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-scan-text\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"scan text icon inner\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </span>\n                                Image\n                            </button>\n                            <button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-4 text-[#61727A] sm:px-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"tab button 3\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\">\n                                <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"file description icon\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-file-description\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"file description icon inner\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </span>\n                                PDF or TXT\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"demo input content container\">\n                            <label class=\"mb-2 block text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#17242B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"text area label\" for=\"preview-text\">\n                                Job description\n                            </label>\n                            <textarea aria-label=\"Preview job description\" class=\"min-h-[210px] w-full resize-none border border-[#AFC2CA] bg-[#EEF3F5] p-4 text-[15px] leading-6 text-[#42545C] outline-hidden focus:border-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"job description text area\" id=\"preview-text\" readonly=\"\">We are looking for motivated graduates to join our growing team. Earn ₹75,000 per month with no experience required. To schedule your interview, please pay a ₹499 registration fee today.</textarea>\n                            <div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-col gap-5 border-t border-[#AFC2CA] pt-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-3-3\" data-name=\"demo analysis footer\">\n                                <div class=\"text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"processing privacy note\">\n                                    Text is processed temporarily and not stored unnecessarily.\n                                </div>\n                                <button class=\"clip-corner-small w-fit bg-[#183A72] px-5 py-3 text-[14px] font-semibold text-white hover:bg-[#102E5C] focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-[#D9A441] focus-visible:outline-offset-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"analyze job button\" type=\"button\">\n                                    Analyze a job\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between px-1 text-[11px] text-[#61727A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"demo input status footer\">\n                        <span class=\"jobshield-mono uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"demo state text\">\n                            Preview state / pasted text\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"disclaimer text\">\n                            Demo Data · not a guarantee\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"border-b-[1.5px] border-[#AFC2CA]\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"workflow section\" id=\"workflow\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1320px] px-6 py-14 sm:px-10 sm:py-16 xl:px-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"workflow content container\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 border-b-[1.5px] border-[#183A72] pb-5 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"workflow section header\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"workflow header text container\">\n                    <div class=\"jobshield-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"workflow step label\">\n                        01 / human-led workflow\n                    </div>\n                    <h2 class=\"jobshield-display mt-2 text-[clamp(2rem,3.5vw,3rem)] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"workflow headline\">\n                        A measured path from posting to next step.\n                    </h2>\n                    <div class=\"jobshield-mono mt-3 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"workflow step summary\">\n                        Paste → Analyze → Understand → Verify\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"max-w-[300px] text-[14px] leading-5 text-[#52656E] md:text-right\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"workflow description\">\n                    The model flags patterns. You verify the employer.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-14 border-t-[1.5px] border-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"workflow process steps grid\">\n                <di