t → features → score\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                <article class=\"mt-8 border-[1.5px] border-[#183A72] bg-[#F9FCFD] p-6 md:mt-10\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-2\" data-name=\"workflow card 2\">\n                    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[23px] text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"workflow card 2 icon wrapper\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-file-search\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"file search icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"jobshield-mono mt-8 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"workflow card 2 category label\">\n                        Report / reason\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"jobshield-display mt-2 text-[31px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-2-3\" data-name=\"workflow card 2 title\">\n                        Risk Explanation\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[290px] text-[15px] leading-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-2-4\" data-name=\"workflow card 2 description\">\n                        See which phrases and missing details affected the assessment.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-7 border-t border-[#AFC2CA] pt-4 text-[11px] text-[#B52A32]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-2-5\" data-name=\"workflow card 2 metric warning\">\n                        4 indicators matched\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                <article class=\"mt-16 border-[1.5px] border-[#183A72] bg-[#F9FCFD] p-6 md:mt-20\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-3\" data-name=\"workflow card 3\">\n                    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[23px] text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-3-1\" data-name=\"workflow card 3 icon wrapper\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-list-checks\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-3-1-1\" data-name=\"list checks