-4-1-2-2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"input section title\">\n                                    Enter the posting details\n                                </h3>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"input section description\">\n                                    Add context first, then review the extracted text before analysis.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"jobshield-mono border border-[#AFC2CA] px-2 py-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.13em] text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"input section analysis identifier\">\n                                Analysis JS-2041\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"input forms container\">\n                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"text input fields container\">\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"job title field\">\n                                    <label class=\"mb-2 block text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"job title label\" for=\"job-title\">\n                                        Job title\n                                        <span class=\"font-normal text-[#B52A32]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"required indicator\">\n                                            *\n                                        </span>\n                                    </label>\n                                    <input class=\"h-11 w-full border border-[#AFC2CA] bg-[#EEF3F5] px-3 text-[15px] text-[#17242B] outline-hidden focus:border-[#183A72] focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#D9A441]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"job title input\" id=\"job-title\" type=\"text\" value=\"Remote Graduate Opportunity\"/>\n                                </div>\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"company name field\">\n                                    <label class=\"mb-2 block text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"company name label\" for=\"company-name\">\n                                        Company name\n                                        <span class=\"font-normal text-[#B52A32]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"required indicator\">\n                                            *\n                                        </span>\n                                    </label>\n                                    <input class=\"h-11 w-full border border-[#AFC2CA] bg-[#EEF3F5] px-3 text-[15px] text-[#17242B] outline-hidden focus:border-[#183A72] focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#D9A441]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"company name input\" id=\"company-name\" type=\"text\" value=\"BrightPath Careers\"/>\n                                </div>\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"website field\">\n                                    <label class=\"mb-2 block text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"website label\" for=\"website\">\n                                        Company website\n                                        <span class=\"font-normal text-[#61727A]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"optional label\">\n                                            (optional)\n                                        </span>\n                                    </label>\n                                    <input class=\"h-11 w-full border border-[#AFC2CA] bg-[#EEF3F5] px-3 text-[15px] text-[#17242B] placeholder:text-[#7A8A91] outline-hidden focus:border-[#183A72] focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#D9A441]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"website input\" id=\"website\" placeholder=\"https://company.example\" type=\"url\"/>\n                                </div>\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"recruiter field\">\n                                    <label class=\"mb-2 block text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"recruiter label\" for=\"recruiter\">\n                                        Recruiter information\n                                        <span class=\"font-normal text-[#61727A]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"optional label\">\n                                            (optional)\n                                        </span>\n                                    </label>\n                                    <input class=\"h-11 w-full border border-[#AFC2CA] bg-[#EEF3F5] px-3 text-[15px] text-[#17242B] placeholder:text-[#7A8A91] outline-hidden focus:border-[#183A72] focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#D9A441]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"recruiter input\" id=\"recruiter\" placeholder=\"Name, email, or profile\" type=\"text\"/>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-6\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"input source selection\">\n                                <div class=\"mb-2 text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"selection label\">\n                                    Input source\n                                </div>\n                                <div aria-label=\"Choose an input source\" class=\"flex flex-wrap border border-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"input type selection tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n                                    <button aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-b-2 border-[#183A72] bg-[#EEF3F5] px-4 py-3 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"tab button 1\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\">\n                                        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"file search icon\">\n                                            <i class=\"ti ti-file-search\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"file search icon inner\">\n                                            </i>\n                                        </span>\n                                        Paste text\n                                    </button>\n                                    <button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-l border-[#183A72] px-4 py-3 text-[14px] text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"tab button 2\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\">\n                                        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"scan text icon\">\n                                            <i class=\"ti ti-scan-text\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"scan text icon inner\">\n                                            </i>\n                                        </span>\n                                        Image\n                                    </button>\n                                    <button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-l border-[#183A72] px-4 py-3 text-[14px] text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"tab button 3\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\">\n                                        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"file description icon\">\n                                            <i class=\"ti ti-file-description\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"file description icon inner\">\n                                            </i>\n                                        </span>\n                                        PDF or TXT\n                                    </button>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.55fr)_minmax(260px,.78fr)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"data file upload section\">\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"extracted text area\">\n                                    <div class=\"mb-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"extracted text header\">\n                                        <label class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"extracted text label\" for=\"extracted-text\">\n                                            Extracted text\n                                            <span class=\"font-normal text-[#61727A]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"editable indicator\">\n                                                · editable\n                                            </span>\n                                        </label>\n                                        <span class=\"jobshield-mono text-[10px] text-[#61727A]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"character count label\">\n                                            524 characters\n                                        </span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <textarea class=\"min-h-[238px] w-full resize-y border border-[#AFC2CA] bg-[#EEF3F5] p-4 text-[15px] leading-6 text-[#17242B] outline-hidden focus:border-[#183A72] focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#D9A441]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"extracted text area input\" id=\"extracted-text\">Congratulations! You have been shortlisted for our remote graduate opportunity. Earn ₹75,000 per month with no experience required. To schedule your interview, pay a ₹499 registration fee today. Reply on WhatsApp for immediate confirmation.</textarea>\n                                    <div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-[12px] text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-1-3\" data-name=\"text details summary\">\n                                        <span data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-1-3-1\" data-name=\"text source label\">\n                                            Source: pasted text\n                                        </span>\n                                        <span data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-1-3-2\" data-name=\"language label\">\n                                            Language: English\n                                        </span>\n                                        <span data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-1-3-3\" data-name=\"review instruction\">\n                                            Review before analysis\n                                        </span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"border border-[#AFC2CA] bg-[#EEF3F5] p-4\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"file upload container\">\n                                    <div class=\"jobshield-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"upload title\">\n                                        Upload slip\n                                    </div>\n                                    <label class=\"mt-4 flex min-h-[165px] cursor-pointer flex-col items-center justify-center border border-dashed border-[#183A72] px-5 text-center hover:bg-[#F9FCFD] focus-within:outline-3 focus-within:outline-[#D9A441] focus-within:outline-offset-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"drop zone\" for=\"job-file\">\n                                        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[24px] text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"upload icon\">\n                                            <i class=\"ti ti-upload\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"upload icon inner\">\n                                            </i>\n                                        </span>\n                                        <span class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"upload text title\">\n                                            Choose a posting file\n                                        </span>\n                                        <span class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"upload format instruction\">\n                                            JPG, JPEG, PNG, TXT, or PDF\n                                            <br data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"instruction line break\"/>\n                                            Maximum 10 MB\n                                        </span>\n                                        <input accept=\".jpg,.jpeg,.png,.txt,.pdf\" class=\"sr-only\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-2-2-4\" data-name=\"file input element\" id=\"job-file\" type=\"file\"/>\n                                    </label>\n                                    <div class=\"mt-4 border-t border-[#AFC2CA] pt-3 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"file privacy notice\">\n                                        Images are OCR-extracted. Documents are parsed, then shown here for review.\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col gap-5 border-t border-[#AFC2CA] pt-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-4\" data-name=\"input submission footer\">\n                                <div class=\"flex max-w-[610px] gap-3 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"privacy policy summary\">\n                                    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 text-[17px] text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"info icon\">\n                                        <i class=\"ti ti-info-circle\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"info icon inner\">\n                                        </i>\n                                    </span>\n                                    <p data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"privacy policy text\">\n                                        <span class=\"font-semibold text-[#17242B]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-4-1-2-1\">\n                                            Privacy note:\n                                        </span>\n                                        Files are type-validated, processed temporarily, and not stored unnecessarily. Do not add passwords, OTPs, or banking credentials.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <button class=\"clip-corner-small w-full bg-[#183A72] px-6 py-3 text-[15px] font-semibold text-white hover:bg-[#102E5C] focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-[#D9A441] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 sm:w-auto\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"analyze job button\" type=\"button\">\n                                    Analyze a job\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-7 border-t border-[#AFC2CA] pt-5\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-5\" data-name=\"demo scenarios section\">\n                                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"scenarios header\">\n                                    <div data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"scenarios text container\">\n                                        <div class=\"jobshield-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"scenarios section title\">\n                                            Demo scenarios / sample inputs\n                                        </div>\n                                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-5-1-1-2\" data-name=\"scenarios disclaimer\">\n                                            All sample predictions are Demo Data and are not guarantees.\n                                        </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <span class=\"jobshield-mono text-[10px] text-[#A66A00]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"scenarios logic label\">\n                                        Rule-based sample behavior\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 border border-[#AFC2CA] md:grid-cols-3\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"scenarios cards grid\">\n                                    <div class=\"border-b border-[#AFC2CA] p-4 md:border-b-0 md:border-r\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"scenario card 1\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-5-2-1-1\" data-name=\"scenario card 1 header\">\n                                            <span class=\"jobshield-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#257A58]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-5-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"scenario label\">\n                                                Demo 01\n                                            </span>\n                                            <span class=\"border border-[#257A58] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-[#257A58]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2-5-2-1-1-2\