class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] leading-5 text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-2-2-4-2-3-2-2\">\n                                                    “Today” and “immediate confirmation” add pressure before the offer can be checked.\n                                                </p>\n                                                <p class=\"mt-2 jobshield-mono text-[11px] text-[#C55216]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-2-2-4-2-3-2-3\">\n                                                    “today” · “immediate confirmation”\n                                                </p>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[24px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-3 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-2-2-4-2-4\" data-name=\"risk bar segment 4\">\n                                            <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[18px] text-[#A66A00]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-2-2-4-2-4-1\">\n                                                <i class=\"ti ti-info-circle\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-2-2-4-2-4-1-1\">\n                                                </i>\n                                            </span>\n                                            <div data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-2-2-4-2-4-2\">\n                                                <div class=\"font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-2-2-4-2-4-2-1\">\n                                                    Limited company information\n                                                </div>\n                                                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] leading-5 text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-2-2-4-2-4-2-2\">\n                                                    The sample posting does not provide a verifiable company website or office details.\n                                                </p>\n                                                <p class=\"mt-2 jobshield-mono text-[11px] text-[#A66A