 </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-5 flex gap-3 border-t border-[#AFC2CA] pt-4 text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-1-3\" data-name=\"evaluation note\">\n                                    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[18px] text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"info icon\">\n                                        <i class=\"ti ti-info-circle\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"icon inner\">\n                                        </i>\n                                    </span>\n                                    <p data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"note text\">\n                                        Run the training and validation pipeline with a real dataset to populate these cells. Demo Data does not stand in for model accuracy.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"border border-[#AFC2CA] bg-[#F9FCFD] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"confusion matrix card\">\n                                <h4 class=\"jobshield-display text-[22px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-2-1\" data-name=\"confusion matrix title\">\n                                    Confusion matrix\n                                </h4>\n                                <p class=\"text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-2-2\" data-name=\"confusion matrix description\">\n                                    The matrix will show false positives and false negatives after evaluation.\n                                </p>\n                                <div class=\"mt-6 border-[1.5px] border-[#AFC2CA] bg-[#EEF3F5] p-4\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-2-3\" data-name=\"confusion matrix grid\">\n                                    <div class=\"jobshield-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"matrix state label\">\n                                        Evaluation state\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"mt-3 grid grid-cols-[62px_1fr_1fr] text-center text-[10px] text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"matrix table\">\n                                        <div data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"blank cell\">\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"border-b border-[#AFC2CA] p-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"pred lower risk label\">\n                                            Pred. lower risk\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"border-b border-[#AFC2CA] p-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"pred suspicious label\">\n                                            Pred. suspicious\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"border-r border-[#AFC2CA] p-3 [writing-mode:vertical-rl]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-2-3-2-4\" data-name=\"actual label\">\n                                            Actual label\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"flex min-h-[68px] items-center justify-center border-b border-r border-[#AFC2CA] p-2 jobshield-mono text-[18px] text-[#61727A]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-2-3-2-5\" data-name=\"matrix cell 1\">\n                                            —\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"flex min-h-[68px] items-center justify-center border-b border-[#AFC2CA] p-2 jobshield-mono text-[18px] text-[#61727A]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-2-3-2-6\" data-name=\"matrix cell 2\">\n                                            —\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"flex min-h-[68px] items-center justify-center border-r border-[#AFC2CA] p-2 jobshield-mono text-[18px] text-[#61727A]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-2-3-2-7\" data-name=\"matrix cell 3\">\n                                            —\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"flex min-h-[68px] items-center justify-center p-2 jobshield-mono text-[18px] text-[#61727A]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-2-3-2-8\" data-name=\"matrix cell 4\">\n                                            —\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"mt-4 border-t border-[#AFC2CA] pt-4 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#B52A32]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"matrix evaluation status\">\n                                        Evaluation results are not available yet.\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-5 border-t border-[#AFC2CA] pt-4 text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-2-2-4\" data-name=\"confusion matrix explanation\">\n                                    Once a dataset is connected, the selected model can be compared using Accuracy, Precision, Recall, F1-score, and this matrix.\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <footer class=\"border-t-[1.5px] border-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-5\" data-name=\"footer\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1320px] grid-cols-1 gap-8 px-6 py-10 sm:px-10 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_.8fr_.8fr] xl:px-0\" data-kid=\"1-5-1\" data-name=\"footer grid\">\n            <div data-kid=\"1-5-1-1\" data-name=\"footer section 1\">\n                <div class=\"jobshield-display text-[22px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer title\">\n                    JobShield AI\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[420px] text-[14px] leading-6 text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2\" data-name=\"footer description\">\n                    A careful starting point for students, freshers, and job seekers reviewing unfamiliar postings before they apply.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"1-5-1-2\" data-name=\"footer section 2\">\n                <div class=\"jobshield-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"footer section 2 title\">\n                    Privacy handling\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mt-3 text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"footer section 2 content\">\n                    Validated uploads are processed temporarily. Avoid adding passwords, OTPs, bank details, or other sensitive information.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"1-5-1-3\" data-name=\"footer section 3\">\n                <div class=\"jobshield-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#183A72]\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-3-1\" data-name=\"footer section 3 title\">\n                    Project state\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mt-3 text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#52656E]\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-3-2\" data-name=\"footer section 3 content\">\n                    Demo Mode · model confidence unavailable · evaluation results not available yet.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"border-t border-[#AFC2CA]\" data-kid=\"1-5-2\" data-name=\"copyright container\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1320px] flex-col gap-3 px-6 py-4 text-[12px] text-[#52656E] sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:px-10 xl:px-0\" 